  "term": "TPA",
  "definition": "TPA refers to T-Pattern and T-String analysis, a software-supported method for comparing and studying behavioral patterns. In applied behavioral science research, it is used to examine temporal, spatial, and other organized patterns in human and non-human behavior.",
